WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:100%,end
Open QR stickers. Each machine has its own code.
Press Print.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:100%,end
The sticker has the machine’s identifier and a QR code.
The example is ABC-123.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000 line:100%,end
Fix the sticker on a flat surface of the machine,
where the driver can see it and point at it.
